// A CALL RESULT crossing a kind boundary. Before `typeOfExpr` the classifier switched on the node and
// knew only literals and simple places, so every call handed its result over unexamined — the shape a
// real program hits far more often than the bare `int32 x = "…"` the spine was built on.
fn string maker() { return "s"; }

fn int32 main() {
    int32 x = maker();
    return 0;
}
